</a>
<div class="p-8">
<h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-villa-gold mb-4 uppercase">The Great Hall on the Ground Floor (The Stage)</h3>
<div class="text-sm text-left text-gray-700 space-y-4">
<p>Above the cellar lies a 300 sqm volume. Featuring historical floor hatches (visually and functionally connecting to the lower level), this environment lends itself to any ambitious vision: a tasting room, a private art gallery, an exclusive showroom, or a luxury SPA overlooking the greenery.</p>
</div>
