<h2 class="font-serif text-3xl text-villa-gold mb-8 uppercase tracking-widest">Interior Vision: Design or Tradition?</h2>
<p class="text-lg mb-12 opacity-90">The property includes a heritage of period furnishings but does not constrain your lifestyle. The villa lends itself to a dual interpretation:</p>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 text-left">
<div>
