</div>
<div>
<h4 class="font-serif text-xl text-villa-gold mb-4 uppercase">Contemporary</h4>
<p class="text-sm leading-relaxed opacity-80">The boldest move. Reallocate or alienate some of the ancient furnishings to introduce Modern and Minimalist Design pieces. The 17th-century volumes, with their high ceilings and terracotta floors, are the perfect stage for contrast with contemporary decor (Architectural Digest style).</p>
</div>
</div>
<p class="mt-12 font-serif text-2xl text-villa-gold italic">The house is a blank canvas ready for your vision.</p>
